(MASTER SAAS AND CLOUD SERVICES AGREEMENT) Tj T*
(Contract Reference: APEX-MSA-2026-089) Tj T*
(Between: ApexCloud Infrastructure Inc. \("Vendor"\) and Enterprise Customer Corp. \("Customer"\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Scope of Services and Affiliates.) Tj T*
(1.1 Vendor shall provide the cloud hosting, analytics platform, and support services described) Tj T*
(in each mutually executed Order Form in accordance with a 99.95% monthly uptime Service Level) Tj T*
(Agreement.) Tj T*
(1.2 Customer's majority-owned Affiliates are expressly authorized to access and use the) Tj T*
(Services under the terms of this Agreement without additional platform access fees.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Term, Auto-Renewal and Termination Rights.) Tj T*
(2.1 This Agreement shall commence on the Effective Date and continue for an Initial Term of) Tj T*
(twenty-four \(24\) months. Thereafter, this Agreement shall automatically renew for successive) Tj T*
(thirty-six \(36\) month periods unless Customer provides written notice of non-renewal at least) Tj T*
(120 days prior to the expiration of the then-current term.) Tj T*
(2.2 All Order Forms are strictly non-cancellable, all fees are non-refundable, and Customer) Tj T*
(shall have no right to terminate for convenience under any circumstances.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Fees, Invoicing, Payment Terms and Price Escalation.) Tj T*
(3.1 All fees are due and payable Net 15 \(within fifteen \(15\) days of invoice date\) without) Tj T*
(right of set-off or deduction. Overdue balances shall accrue compound interest at the rate of) Tj T*
(2.5% per month \(30% per annum\), and Vendor may immediately suspend Services if any invoice) Tj T*
(remains unpaid for five \(5\) days.) Tj T*
(3.2 Vendor reserves the right to increase fees at any time in its sole discretion upon fifteen) Tj T*
(\(15\) days' notice, and renewal terms shall be subject to uncapped annual price adjustments.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Intellectual Property and Work Product Ownership.) Tj T*
(4.1 Notwithstanding anything to the contrary, all deliverables, custom configurations, software) Tj T*
(integrations, and work product funded by Customer under any Statement of Work shall belong) Tj T*
(exclusively to Vendor.) Tj T*
(4.2 Customer hereby assigns to Vendor all rights in deliverables and acknowledges that all) Tj T*
(derivative works shall remain the sole property of Vendor, subject only to a revocable,) Tj T*
(non-exclusive license during the active Term.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Indemnification Obligations.) Tj T*
(5.1 Customer shall indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Vendor, its officers, directors, and) Tj T*
(affiliates solely at Customer's expense against any and all third-party claims, liabilities,) Tj T*
(and expenses arising out of or relating to this Agreement or Customer's use of the Services.) Tj T*
(5.2 Vendor disclaims any obligation to indemnify Customer for third-party intellectual property) Tj T*
(infringement, data security incidents, or regulatory penalties.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Limitation of Liability and Consequential Damages.) Tj T*
(6.1 IN NO EVENT SHALL VENDOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, PUNITIVE, OR) Tj T*
(CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES. Customer waives all claims for consequential damages while Customer's) Tj T*
(liability to Vendor remains uncapped.) Tj T*
(6.2 Vendor's maximum aggregate liability for all claims arising under or related to this) Tj T*
(Agreement \(including data breaches and IP claims\) shall in no event exceed the fees paid in the) Tj T*
ET
